    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Create a cinematic video concept based on this brand strategy.\n\nBrand Analysis:\n{{ $json.output.brand_identity.visual_elements }}\n{{ $json.output.brand_identity.personality }}\n{{ $json.output.storytelling_potential.emotional_hooks }}\n\nCampaign Brief:\n{{ $('Brand Asset Input').item.json['Campaign Brief'] }}\n\nTarget Mood: {{ $('Brand Asset Input').item.json['Target Mood'] || 'authentic' }}\n\nDevelop a UGC style video concept that brings this brand to life through compelling visual storytelling. Show the character talking, walking through life etc. UGC vlog\n\nIt should look and feel like a vlog. Make sure the video is lip synced to the audio. Make sure there's dialogue in the video too.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "ROLE: Creative Director & Video Conceptualist\n\nOBJECTIVE: Transform brand strategy into compelling video concepts that drive engagement and conversion.\n\nCREATIVE FRAMEWORK:\n\n1. VISUAL STORYTELLING\n- Hero's journey adaptation for brands\n- Emotional arc development\n- Visual metaphor integration\n- Cinematic composition principles\n\n2. ENGAGEMENT MECHANICS\n- Hook creation (first 3 seconds)\n- Tension and resolution cycles\n- Call-to-action integration\n- Platform optimization considerations\n\n3. PRODUCTION APPROACH\n- Achievable with AI video generation\n- Focus on strong composition over complex effects\n- Emphasize lighting and mood\n- Consider aspect ratios and formats\n\n4. BRAND INTEGRATION\n- Subtle product placement\n- Natural brand moment inclusion\n- Authentic lifestyle contexts\n- Emotional brand association building\n\nOUTPUT STYLE:\n- Think like a film director\n- Balance artistic vision with marketing goals\n- Create concepts that feel premium yet accessible\n- Focus on universal human emotions\n- Ensure scalability across multiple assets\n\nAVOID:\n- Overly commercial language\n- Generic stock footage descriptions\n- Complex technical requirements\n- Unrealistic production demands"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        816,
        128
      ],
      "id": "6ad492c9-f0a6-464e-8d32-bbbb79ba0ffd",
      "name": "Creative Director"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n\t\"video_concept\": {\n\t\t\"opening_hook\": \"string\",\n\t\t\"main_narrative\": \"string\",\n\t\t\"visual_style\": \"string\",\n\t\t\"emotional_arc\": \"string\"\n\t},\n\t\"production_notes\": {\n\t\t\"lighting_mood\": \"string\",\n\t\t\"composition_style\": \"string\",\n\t\t\"pacing_rhythm\": \"string\"\n\t},\n\t\"brand_integration\": {\n\t\t\"product_moments\": \"string\",\n\t\t\"lifestyle_context\": \"string\",\n\t\t\"call_to_action\": \"string\"\n\t}\n}"
      },
