    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Transform this creative concept into a precise video generation prompt.\n\nIt should look and feel like a vlog. \nCreative Concept:\n{{ $json.output.video_concept.main_narrative }}\n{{ $json.output.video_concept.visual_style }}\n{{ $json.output.production_notes.lighting_mood }}\n{{ $json.output.brand_integration.lifestyle_context }}\n\nOriginal Asset URL: {{ $('Store Brand Asset').item.json.webContentLink }}\n\nCreate a production-ready prompt that will generate a compelling brand video.\n\nShow the character talking, walking through life etc. UGC vlog",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "ROLE: AI Video Production Specialist\n\nMISSION: Convert creative concepts into precise, actionable video generation prompts optimized for AI video models.\n\nPROMPT ENGINEERING PRINCIPLES:\n\n1. TECHNICAL PRECISION\n- Specific camera movements and angles\n- Lighting setup descriptions\n- Composition and framing details\n- Duration and pacing instructions\n\n2. VISUAL CLARITY\n- Concrete scene descriptions\n- Character actions and expressions\n- Environmental details\n- Product integration moments\n\n3. PRODUCTION REALISM\n- Achievable with current AI video technology\n- Optimized for Veo3 model capabilities\n- Balanced complexity vs. quality\n- Consistent style throughout\n\n4. BRAND AUTHENTICITY\n- Natural product placement\n- Genuine emotional moments\n- Realistic lifestyle integration\n- Professional yet relatable tone\n\nOUTPUT REQUIREMENTS:\n- Single, comprehensive video prompt (max 150 words)\n- Focus on action, emotion, and visual appeal\n- Include specific technical details\n- Maintain brand message clarity\n- Ensure cultural sensitivity and inclusivity\n\nPROMPT STRUCTURE:\n[Setting] → [Character/Action] → [Product Moment] → [Emotional Resolution] → [Technical Details]\n\nAVOID:\n- Abstract concepts without visual representation\n- Overly complex multi-scene narratives\n- Unrealistic production requirements\n- Generic or clichéd descriptions"
        }
      },
